ogies: https://www.owasp.org/index.php/Penetration_ testing_methodologies PCI Security Standards Council: https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/documents/ Penetration-Testing-Guidance-v1_1.pdf Privacy Companion Guide for Controls v8: https://www.cisecurity.org/insights/white-papers/ cis-controls-v8-privacy-companion-guide SAFECode Application Security Addendum: https://safecode.org/cis-controls/ SANS: https://www.sans.org/security-awareness-training/resources SME Guide for Controls v8: https://www.cisecurity.org/insights/white-papers/implementation- guide-for-small-and-medium-sized-enterprises-cis-controls-ig1 The Software Alliance: https://www.bsa.org/reports/updated-bsa-framework-for- secure-software Trailhead Training Courses for CIS Controls: https://www.cisecurity.org/controls/trailhead- training-courses Verizon Data Breach Investigations Report: https://www.verizon.com/business/resources/reports/dbir/ A12 Resources and References CIS Controls v8.1.2 Controls and Safeguards Index" ;
    ciso:identifier "18.5" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-detect .

cis:2.1 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish and Maintain a Software Inventory" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:2 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and maintain a detailed inventory of all licensed software installed on enterprise assets. The software inventory must document the title, publisher, initial install/use date, and business purpose for each entry; where appropriate, include the Uniform Resource Locator (URL), app store(s), version(s), deployment mechanism, decommission date, and number of licenses. Review and update the software inventory bi-annually, or more frequently." ;
    ciso:identifier "2.1" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-identify .

cis:2.2 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Ensure Authorized Software is Currently Supported" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:2 ;
    ciso:description "Ensure that only currently supported software is designated as authorized in the software inventory for enterprise assets. If software is unsupported, yet necessary for the fulfillment of the enterprise’s mission, document an exception detailing mitigating controls and residual risk acceptance. For any unsupported software without an exception documentation, designate as unauthorized. Review the software list to verify software support at least monthly, or more frequently." ;
    ciso:identifier "2.2" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-identify .

cis:2.3 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Address Unauthorized Software" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:2 ;
    ciso:description "Ensure that unauthorized software is either removed from use on enterprise assets or receives a documented exception. Review monthly, or more frequently." ;
    ciso:identifier "2.3" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-respond .

cis:2.4 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Utilize Automated Software Inventory Tools" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:2 ;
    ciso:description "Utilize software inventory tools, when possible, throughout the enterprise to automate the discovery and documentation of installed software." ;
    ciso:identifier "2.4" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-detect .

cis:2.5 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Allowlist Authorized Software" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:2 ;
    ciso:description "Use technical controls, such as application allowlisting, to ensure that only authorized software can execute or be accessed. Reassess bi-annually, or more frequently." ;
    ciso:identifier "2.5" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:2.6 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Allowlist Authorized Libraries" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:2 ;
    ciso:description "Use technical controls to ensure that only authorized software libraries, such as specific .dll, .ocx, and .so files, are allowed to load into a system process. Block unauthorized libraries from loading into a system process. Reassess bi-annually, or more frequently." ;
    ciso:identifier "2.6" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:2.7 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Allowlist Authorized Scripts" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:2 ;
    ciso:description "Use technical controls, such as digital signatures and version control, to ensure that only authorized scripts, such as specific .ps1, and .py files are allowed to execute. Block unauthorized scripts from executing. Reassess bi-annually, or more frequently." ;
    ciso:identifier "2.7" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:3.1 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish and Maintain a Data Management Process" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and maintain a documented data management process. In the process, address data sensitivity, data owner, handling of data, data retention limits, and disposal requirements, based on sensitivity and retention standards for the enterprise. Review and update documentation annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.1" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-govern .

cis:3.10 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Encrypt Sensitive Data in Transit" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Encrypt sensitive data in transit. Example implementations can include: Transport Layer Security (TLS) and Open Secure Shell (OpenSSH)." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.10" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:3.11 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Encrypt Sensitive Data at Rest" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Encrypt sensitive data at rest on servers, applications, and databases. Storage-layer encryption, also known as server-side encryption, meets the minimum requirement of this Safeguard. Additional encryption methods may include application-layer encryption, also known as client-side encryption, where access to the data storage device(s) does not permit access to the plain-text data." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.11" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:3.12 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Segment Data Processing and Storage Based on Sensitivity" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Segment data processing and storage based on the sensitivity of the data. Do not process sensitive data on enterprise assets intended for lower sensitivity data." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.12" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:3.13 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Deploy a Data Loss Prevention Solution" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Implement an automated tool, such as a host-based Data Loss Prevention (DLP) tool to identify all sensitive data stored, processed, or transmitted through enterprise assets, including those located onsite or at a remote service provider, and update the enterprise’s data inventory." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.13" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:3.14 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Log Sensitive Data Access" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Log sensitive data access, including modification and disposal." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.14" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-detect .

cis:3.2 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish and Maintain a Data Inventory" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and maintain a data inventory based on the enterprise’s data management process. Inventory sensitive data, at a minimum. Review and update inventory annually, at a minimum, with a priority on sensitive data." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.2" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-identify .

cis:3.3 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Configure Data Access Control Lists" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Configure data access control lists based on a user’s need to know. Apply data access control lists, also known as access permissions, to local and remote file systems, databases, and applications." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.3" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:3.4 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Enforce Data Retention" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Retain data according to the enterprise’s documented data management process. Data retention must include both minimum and maximum timelines." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.4" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:3.5 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Securely Dispose of Data" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Securely dispose of data as outlined in the enterprise’s documented data management process. Ensure the disposal process and method are commensurate with the data sensitivity." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.5" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:3.6 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Encrypt Data on End-User Devices" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Encrypt data on end-user devices containing sensitive data. Example implementations can include: Windows BitLocker®, Apple FileVault®, Linux® dm-crypt." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.6" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:3.7 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish and Maintain a Data Classification Scheme" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and maintain an overall data classification scheme for the enterprise. Enterprises may use labels, such as “Sensitive,” “Confidential,” and “Public,” and classify their data according to those labels. Review and update the classification scheme annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.7" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-identify .

cis:3.8 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Document Data Flows" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Document data flows. Data flow documentation includes service provider data flows and should be based on the enterprise’s data management process. Review and update documentation annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.8" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-identify .

cis:3.9 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Encrypt Data on Removable Media" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:3 ;
    ciso:description "Encrypt data on removable media." ;
    ciso:identifier "3.9" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:4.1 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish and Maintain a Secure Configuration Process" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-documentation ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:4 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and maintain a documented secure configuration process for enterprise assets (end-user devices, including portable and mobile, non-computing/IoT devices, and servers) and software (operating systems and applications). Review and update documentation annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard." ;
    ciso:identifier "4.1" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-govern .

cis:4.10 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Enforce Automatic Device Lockout on Portable End-User Devices" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-devices ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:4 ;
    ciso:description "Enforce automatic device lockout following a predetermined threshold of local failed authentication attempts on portable end-user devices, where supported. For laptops, do not allow more than 20 failed authentication attempts; for tablets and smartphones, no more than 10 failed authentication attempts. Example implementations include Microsoft® InTune Device Lock and Apple® Configuration Profile maxFailedAttempts." ;
    ciso:identifier "4.10" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:4.11 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Enforce Remote Wipe Capability on Portable End-User Devices" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:4 ;
    ciso:description "Remotely wipe enterprise data from enterprise-owned portable end-user devices when deemed appropriate such as lost or stolen devices, or when an individual no longer supports the enterprise." ;
    ciso:identifier "4.11" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:4.12 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Separate Enterprise Workspaces on Mobile End-User Devices" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:4 ;
    ciso:description "Ensure separate enterprise workspaces are used on mobile end-user devices, where supported. Example implementations include using an Apple® Configuration Profile or Android™ Work Profile to separate enterprise applications and data from personal applications and data." ;
    ciso:identifier "4.12" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:4.2 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish and Maintain a Secure Configuration Process for Network" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-documentation ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:4 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and maintain a documented secure configuration process for network devices. Review and update documentation annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard." ;
    ciso:identifier "4.2" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-govern .

cis:4.3 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Configure Automatic Session Locking on Enterprise Assets" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-devices ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:4 ;
    ciso:description "Configure automatic session locking on enterprise assets after a defined period of inactivity. For general purpose operating systems, the period must not exceed 15 minutes. For mobile end-user devices, the period must not exceed 2 minutes." ;
    ciso:identifier "4.3" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:4.4 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Implement and Manage a Firewall on Servers" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-devices ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:4 ;
    ciso:description "Implement and manage a firewall on servers, where supported. Example implementations include a virtual firewall, operating system firewall, or a third-party firewall agent." ;
    ciso:identifier "4.4" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:4.5 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Implement and Manage a Firewall on End-User Devices" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-devices ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:4 ;
    ciso:description "Implement and manage a host-based firewall or port-filtering tool on end-user devices, with a default-deny rule that drops all traffic except those services and ports that are explicitly allowed." ;
    ciso:identifier "4.5" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:4.6 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Securely Manage Enterprise Assets and Software" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-devices ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:4 ;
    ciso:description "Securely manage enterprise assets and software. Example implementations include managing configuration through version-controlled Infrastructure-as-Code (IaC) and accessing administrative interfaces over secure network protocols, such as Secure Shell (SSH) and Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure (HTTPS). Do not use insecure management protocols, such as Telnet (Teletype Network) and HTTP, unless operationally essential." ;
    ciso:identifier "4.6" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:4.7 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Manage Default Accounts on Enterprise Assets and Software" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-users ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:4 ;
    ciso:description "Manage default accounts on enterprise assets and software, such as root, administrator, and other pre-configured vendor accounts. Example implementations can include: disabling default accounts or making them unusable." ;
    ciso:identifier "4.7" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:4.8 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Uninstall or Disable Unnecessary Services on Enterprise Assets" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-devices ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:4 ;
    ciso:description "Uninstall or disable unnecessary services on enterprise assets and software, such as an unused file sharing service, web application module, or service function." ;
    ciso:identifier "4.8" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:4.9 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Configure Trusted DNS Servers on Enterprise Assets" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-devices ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:4 ;
    ciso:description "Configure trusted DNS servers on network infrastructure. Example implementations include configuring network devices to use enterprise-controlled DNS servers and/or reputable externally accessible DNS servers." ;
    ciso:identifier "4.9" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:5.1 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish and Maintain an Inventory of Accounts" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-users ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:5 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and maintain an inventory of all accounts managed in the enterprise. The inventory must at a minimum include user, administrator, and service accounts. The inventory, at a minimum, should contain the person’s name, username, start/stop dates, and department. Validate that all active accounts are authorized, on a recurring schedule at a minimum quarterly, or more frequently." ;
    ciso:identifier "5.1" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-identify .

cis:5.2 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Use Unique Passwords" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-users ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:5 ;
    ciso:description "Use unique passwords for all enterprise assets. Best practice implementation includes, at a minimum, an 8-character password for accounts using Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) and a 14-character password for accounts not using MFA." ;
    ciso:identifier "5.2" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:5.3 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Disable Dormant Accounts" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-users ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:5 ;
    ciso:description "Delete or disable any dormant accounts after a period of 45 days of inactivity, where supported." ;
    ciso:identifier "5.3" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:5.4 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Restrict Administrator Privileges to Dedicated Administrator Accounts" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-users ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:5 ;
    ciso:description "Restrict administrator privileges to dedicated administrator accounts on enterprise assets. Conduct general computing activities, such as internet browsing, email, and productivity suite use, from the user’s primary, non-privileged account." ;
    ciso:identifier "5.4" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:5.5 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish and Maintain an Inventory of Service Accounts" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-users ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:5 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and maintain an inventory of service accounts. The inventory, at a minimum, must contain department owner, review date, and purpose. Perform service account reviews to validate that all active accounts are authorized, on a recurring schedule at a minimum quarterly, or more frequently." ;
    ciso:identifier "5.5" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-identify .

cis:5.6 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Centralize Account Management" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-users ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:5 ;
    ciso:description "Centralize account management through a directory or identity service." ;
    ciso:identifier "5.6" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-govern .

cis:6.1 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish an Access Granting Process" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-documentation ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:6 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and follow a documented process, preferably automated, for granting access to enterprise assets upon new hire or role change of a user." ;
    ciso:identifier "6.1" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-govern .

cis:6.2 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish an Access Revoking Process" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-documentation ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:6 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and follow a process, preferably automated, for revoking access to enterprise assets, through disabling accounts immediately upon termination, rights revocation, or role change of a user. Disabling accounts, instead of deleting accounts, may be necessary to preserve audit trails." ;
    ciso:identifier "6.2" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-govern .

cis:6.3 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Require MFA for Externally-Exposed Applications" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-users ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:6 ;
    ciso:description "Require all externally-exposed enterprise or third-party applications to enforce MFA, where supported. Enforcing MFA through a directory service or SSO provider is a satisfactory implementation of this Safeguard." ;
    ciso:identifier "6.3" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:6.4 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Require MFA for Remote Network Access" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-users ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:6 ;
    ciso:description "Require MFA for remote network access." ;
    ciso:identifier "6.4" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:6.5 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Require MFA for Administrative Access" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-users ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:6 ;
    ciso:description "Require MFA for all administrative access accounts, where supported, on all enterprise assets, whether managed on-site or through a service provider." ;
    ciso:identifier "6.5" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:6.6 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish and Maintain an Inventory of Authentication and" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:6 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and maintain an inventory of the enterprise’s authentication and authorization systems, including those hosted on-site or at a remote service provider. Review and update the inventory, at a minimum, annually, or more frequently." ;
    ciso:identifier "6.6" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-identify .

cis:6.7 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Centralize Access Control" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-users ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:6 ;
    ciso:description "Centralize access control for all enterprise assets through a directory service or SSO provider, where supported." ;
    ciso:identifier "6.7" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:6.8 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Define and Maintain Role-Based Access Control" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-users ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:6 ;
    ciso:description "Define and maintain role-based access control, through determining and documenting the access rights necessary for each role within the enterprise to successfully carry out its assigned duties. Perform access control reviews of enterprise assets to validate that all privileges are authorized, on a recurring schedule at a minimum annually, or more frequently." ;
    ciso:identifier "6.8" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-govern .

cis:7.1 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish and Maintain a Vulnerability Management Process" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-documentation ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:7 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and maintain a documented vulnerability management process for enterprise assets. Review and update documentation annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard." ;
    ciso:identifier "7.1" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-govern .

cis:7.2 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish and Maintain a Remediation Process" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-documentation ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:7 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and maintain a risk-based remediation strategy documented in a remediation process, with monthly, or more frequent, reviews." ;
    ciso:identifier "7.2" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-govern .

cis:7.3 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Perform Automated Operating System Patch Management" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:7 ;
    ciso:description "Perform operating system updates on enterprise assets through automated patch management on a monthly, or more frequent, basis." ;
    ciso:identifier "7.3" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:7.4 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Perform Automated Application Patch Management" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:7 ;
    ciso:description "Perform application updates on enterprise assets through automated patch management on a monthly, or more frequent, basis." ;
    ciso:identifier "7.4" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:7.5 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Perform Automated Vulnerability Scans of Internal Enterprise Assets" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:7 ;
    ciso:description "Perform automated vulnerability scans of internal enterprise assets on a quarterly, or more frequent, basis. Conduct both authenticated and unauthenticated scans." ;
    ciso:identifier "7.5" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-identify .

cis:7.6 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Perform Automated Vulnerability Scans of Externally-Exposed" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:7 ;
    ciso:description "Perform automated vulnerability scans of externally-exposed enterprise assets. Perform scans on a monthly, or more frequent, basis." ;
    ciso:identifier "7.6" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-identify .

cis:7.7 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Remediate Detected Vulnerabilities" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:7 ;
    ciso:description "Remediate detected vulnerabilities in software through processes and tooling on a monthly, or more frequent, basis, based on the remediation process." ;
    ciso:identifier "7.7" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-respond .

cis:8.1 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Establish and Maintain an Audit Log Management Process" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-documentation ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:8 ;
    ciso:description "Establish and maintain a documented audit log management process that defines the enterprise’s logging requirements. At a minimum, address the collection, review, and retention of audit logs for enterprise assets. Review and update documentation annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard." ;
    ciso:identifier "8.1" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-govern .

cis:8.10 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Retain Audit Logs" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:8 ;
    ciso:description "Retain audit logs across enterprise assets for a minimum of 90 days." ;
    ciso:identifier "8.10" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:8.11 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Conduct Audit Log Reviews" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:8 ;
    ciso:description "Conduct reviews of audit logs to detect anomalies or abnormal events that could indicate a potential threat. Conduct reviews on a weekly, or more frequent, basis." ;
    ciso:identifier "8.11" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-detect .

cis:8.12 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Collect Service Provider Logs" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:8 ;
    ciso:description "Collect service provider logs, where supported. Example implementations include collecting authentication and authorization events, data creation and disposal events, and user management events." ;
    ciso:identifier "8.12" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-detect .

cis:8.2 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Collect Audit Logs" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:8 ;
    ciso:description "Collect audit logs. Ensure that logging, per the enterprise’s audit log management process, has been enabled across enterprise assets." ;
    ciso:identifier "8.2" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-detect .

cis:8.3 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Ensure Adequate Audit Log Storage" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:8 ;
    ciso:description "Ensure that logging destinations maintain adequate storage to comply with the enterprise’s audit log management process." ;
    ciso:identifier "8.3" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:8.4 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Standardize Time Synchronization" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-network ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:8 ;
    ciso:description "Standardize time synchronization. Configure at least two synchronized time sources across enterprise assets, where supported." ;
    ciso:identifier "8.4" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:8.5 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Collect Detailed Audit Logs" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:8 ;
    ciso:description "Configure detailed audit logging for enterprise assets containing sensitive data. Include event source, date, username, timestamp, source addresses, destination addresses, and other useful elements that could assist in a forensic investigation." ;
    ciso:identifier "8.5" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-detect .

cis:8.6 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Collect DNS Query Audit Logs" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:8 ;
    ciso:description "Collect DNS query audit logs on enterprise assets, where appropriate and supported." ;
    ciso:identifier "8.6" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-detect .

cis:8.7 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Collect URL Request Audit Logs" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:8 ;
    ciso:description "Collect URL request audit logs on enterprise assets, where appropriate and supported." ;
    ciso:identifier "8.7" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-detect .

cis:8.8 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Collect Command-Line Audit Logs" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:8 ;
    ciso:description "Collect command-line audit logs. Example implementations include collecting audit logs from PowerShell®, BASH™, and remote administrative terminals." ;
    ciso:identifier "8.8" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-detect .

cis:8.9 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Centralize Audit Logs" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-data ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:8 ;
    ciso:description "Centralize, to the extent possible, audit log collection and retention across enterprise assets in accordance with the documented audit log management process. Example implementations primarily include leveraging a SIEM tool to centralize multiple log sources." ;
    ciso:identifier "8.9" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-detect .

cis:9.1 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Ensure Use of Only Fully Supported Browsers and Email Clients" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:9 ;
    ciso:description "Ensure only fully supported browsers and email clients are allowed to execute in the enterprise, only using the latest version of browsers and email clients provided through the vendor." ;
    ciso:identifier "9.1" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:9.2 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Use DNS Filtering Services" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-devices ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:9 ;
    ciso:description "Use DNS filtering services on all end-user devices, including remote and on-premises assets, to block access to known malicious domains." ;
    ciso:identifier "9.2" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig1,
        cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:9.3 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Maintain and Enforce Network-Based URL Filters" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-network ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:9 ;
    ciso:description "Enforce and update network-based URL filters to limit an enterprise asset from connecting to potentially malicious or unapproved websites. Example implementations include category- based filtering, reputation-based filtering, or through the use of block lists. Enforce filters for all enterprise assets." ;
    ciso:identifier "9.3" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:9.4 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Restrict Unnecessary or Unauthorized Browser and Email" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-software ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:9 ;
    ciso:description "Restrict, either through uninstalling or disabling, any unauthorized or unnecessary browser or email client plugins, extensions, and add-on applications." ;
    ciso:identifier "9.4" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:9.5 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Implement DMARC" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-network ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:9 ;
    ciso:description "To lower the chance of spoofed or modified emails from valid domains, implement DMARC policy and verification, starting with implementing the Sender Policy Framework (SPF) and the DomainKeys Identified Mail (DKIM) standards." ;
    ciso:identifier "9.5" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:9.6 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Block Unnecessary File Types" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-network ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:9 ;
    ciso:description "Block unnecessary file types attempting to enter the enterprise’s email gateway." ;
    ciso:identifier "9.6" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig2,
        cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

cis:9.7 a ciso:Safeguard ;
    rdfs:label "Deploy and Maintain Email Server Anti-Malware Protections" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cis:framework ;
    ciso:assetType cis:asset-type-network ;
    ciso:belongsToControl cis:9 ;
    ciso:description "Deploy and maintain email server anti-malware protections, such as attachment scanning and/ or sandboxing." ;
    ciso:identifier "9.7" ;
    ciso:implementationGroup cis:ig3 ;
    ciso:securityFunction cis:security-function-protect .

